// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P543048644" "I've got a tense situation brewing, {VillainName}. I've just been alerted to a battle going on between Captain Mako's men and those of Black Scorpion. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I don't know what they're fighting over, but I know it's going to stop.</A> Now."
// AcceptString :
"P451986529" "Stop the fighting"
// SendOffString :
"P2570129896" "Every single operative there had better remember this day, {VillainName}. Give them all a lesson."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2256889385" "Defeat all operatives on boat"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2918117775" "I want that fight ended, {VillainName}. Pronto."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2853127709" "The sounds of battle ring off the rafters."

